WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.188 --> 00:00:17.125
Where do birds fly?

2
00:00:17.126 --> 00:00:29.792
Birds fly in the sky.

3
00:00:29.793 --> 00:00:34.614
Where do trees grow?

4
00:00:34.615 --> 00:00:42.917
Trees grow in the forest.

5
00:00:42.918 --> 00:00:48.847
Where do fish swim?

6
00:00:48.848 --> 00:00:56.438
Fish swim in the pond.

7
00:00:56.439 --> 00:01:02.998
Where do rabbits hop?

8
00:01:02.999 --> 00:01:10.164
Rabbits hop on the grass.

9
00:01:10.165 --> 00:01:18.755
Where do bears sleep?

10
00:01:18.756 --> 00:01:26.817
Bears sleep in a den.

11
00:01:26.818 --> 00:01:33.278
Where do ducks play?

12
00:01:33.279 --> 00:01:43.269
Ducks play in the lake.

13
00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:49.933
Where do crabs hide?

14
00:01:49.934 --> 00:02:01.436
Crabs hide in the sand.

15
00:02:01.437 --> 00:02:09.113
Where do seals live?

16
00:02:09.114 --> 00:02:16.788
Seals live in the ocean.

17
00:02:16.789 --> 00:02:22.531
Where do flowers grow?

18
00:02:22.532 --> 00:02:29.236
Flowers grow in the garden.

19
00:02:29.237 --> 00:02:35.982
Where do you live?

20
00:02:35.983 --> 00:02:43.930
We live in an apartment.

